cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BRIDGE-D in your research, please cite this repository."
title: "BRIDGE-D: Bridging Instruments for Depression"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/RexLawAngus/BRIDGE-D"
keywords:
  - psychometrics
  - depression
  - scale scoring
  - cross-instrument comparison
  - equipercentile linking
  - construct mapping
  - reproducible research
abstract: >
  Instrument-as-data toolkit for scoring and comparing co-administered
  depression scales, with agreement, classification and equipercentile
  linking, empirical item maps, instrument footprints, post-fit content-group
  validation, cross-sample map comparison, and known-truth simulation for
  software validation and sample-size planning.
